Hi Avery,

A quick tour of what shipped in your Slack workspace this month.

Agents in channels
Add an agent to any channel and ask it to summarize a thread, draft a reply, or pull up a file. Agents follow your workspace's permissions, so they only see what you can see.

Canvas templates
Meeting notes, project briefs and weekly updates now start from a template. Pick one from the + menu in any channel.

A quieter Monday
The new weekly recap collects everything you missed over the weekend into one message at the time you choose, instead of a wall of notifications.

See everything that's new: https://slack.com/whats-new?e=0302

